{
  "action": "In general, a standard system update will make all the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-18295",
    "CVE-2026-18298",
    "CVE-2026-18296",
    "CVE-2026-18299"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that GStreamer Good Plugins incorrectly parsed certain\nMRF files. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to execute\narbitrary code. (CVE-2026-18295, CVE-2026-18296)\n\nIt was discovered that GStreamer Good Plugins incorrectly parsed certain\nPNG files. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to execute\narbitrary code. (CVE-2026-18298)\n\nDongHyeon Hwang discovered that GStreamer Good Plugins incorrectly\nhandled certain RTP packets. A remote attacker could possibly use this\nissue to execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2026-18299)",
  "id": "USN-8798-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in GStreamer Good Plugins.",
